<span begin="00:24.310" end="00:24.490"> big</span><span begin="00:24.620" end="00:24.870"> girl</span><span begin="00:25.020" end="00:25.470"> and</span><span begin="00:25.570" end="00:25.820"> it's</span><span begin="00:25.970" end="00:26.470"> your</span><span begin="00:26.610" end="00:28.110"> world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.440" end="00:33.190" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="00:29.440" end="00:29.450">And</span><span begin="00:29.470" end="00:29.610"> I'ma</span><span begin="00:29.720" end="00:29.860"> let</span><span begin="00:29.980" end="00:30.240"> you</span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.360"> do</span><span begin="00:30.430" end="00:30.520"> it</span><span begin="00:30.700" end="00:30.930"> how</span><span begin="00:31.080" end="00:31.270"> you</span><span begin="00:31.350" end="00:32.030"> (wanna,</span><span begin="00:32.150" end="00:32.530"> girl,</span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:33.190"> I'll)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.190" end="00:37.690"><span begin="00:33.190" end="00:33.700">Ride</span><span begin="00:33.820" end="00:34.440"> with</span><span begin="00:34.740" end="00:34.870"> it,</span><span begin="00:35.070" end="00:35.740"> ride</span><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:36.190"> with</span><span begin="00:36.370" end="00:37.690"> it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.690" end="00:42.220"><span begin="00:37.690" end="00:37.700">I</span><span begin="00:37.700" end="00:37.800"> know</span><span begin="00:37.870" end="00:38.070"> you</span><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:38.530"> know,</span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:38.690"> I</span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:39.140"> know</span><span begin="00:39.220" end="00:39.450"> you</span><span begin="00:39.520" end="00:39.950"> wanna</span><span begin="00:40.000" end="00:40.290"> ride</span><span begin="00:40.570" end="00:41.140"> with</span><span begin="00:41.250" end="00:42.220"> it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.220"